[[Antiquated Ducat]]s are a [[currency]] obtained by completing [[events]] throughout [[Starlit Weald]]. They can be spent at various vendors across Castora. {{item icon|Raw Enchanting Stone}} and {{item icon|Antiquated Ducat}} and can be converted at a 1:5 ratio with no limit:
* Consuming 1 Raw Enchanting Stone awards 5 Antiquated Ducats.
* 5 Antiquated Ducats can be used to purchase 1 Raw Enchanting Stone at any Castoran renown vendor.

